# Root context exposes the shared registry; exclude unrelated backend sources.
**
!apps
!apps/web
!apps/web/**
!apps/api
!apps/api/contracts
!apps/api/contracts/inventory-template-references.json

# Dependencies, generated output and local configuration do not belong in images.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
